{"version":1,"content":"<p>據知情人士透露，微軟正在積極遊說特朗普政府，希望阻止一項可能出台的新政策。該政策擬禁止美國進口部分中國製造的光模塊產品，而這一設備被廣泛應用於人工智能數據中心建設，被認為是當前美國AI基礎設施擴張過程中不可或缺的重要組件。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585804.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:32:30.249466+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:07:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:25:52.093098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:25:52.093098+00:00","content_hash":"e2867f9069ead79f55bff1ff092f8244562a4ac749dad7e71ce5e1f8bb866b5f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}